xm-k5-firmware modifications (Apache-2.0, see 项目总规格与开发指南.md):
  1. Makefile: fixed enable block (spec §二), PACKED_FILE_SUFFIX XM.
  2. .github/workflows/build.yml: single-target CI build + 60KB gate
     (docker-image.yml and the stray "h --force-with-lease origin main"
     and payment/ leftovers removed from the fork).
  3. app/rega.c/.h — ZVEI port (include paths only; L3 alarm layer).
  4. app/cecliveseek.c/.h — Live-VFO port; three hooks: 500ms tail
     (main.c), frequency step (app/main.c), MENU_LIVESEEK (menu).
     CommBuff guarded by CommBuffUsingType arbitration. Mode persisted
     at EEPROM 0x38003.
  5. app/emergency.c/.h — three-layer emergency alarm (spec §四):
     TX_freq_check first (blocked -> local screamer only + screen
     禁止发射 via RADIO_SetVfoState(VFO_STATE_TX_DISABLE)), 1kHz x3
     prep tones, then per four-position mode: L1 base wail / L2 MDC
     op=0x00 (+auto op=0x20 ACK) / L3 ZVEI 21414. Mode at 0x38000.
  6. ACTION_OPT_EMERGENCY added to settings.h/action.c table and
     SIDEFUNCTIONS ("SOS"); factory default side key 1 long press
     (settings.c).
  7. Menus: MENU_EMERGENCY (four positions, existing font glyphs
     关闭/本地响铃/回复响应/本地响铃回复响应) and MENU_LIVESEEK added.
  8. ui/xm_menu.c/.h — menu zone badge "[1]".."[6]" (spec §五) and CSS
     tri-state helpers.
  9. M4.2: two-digit direct jump gets a 2s timeout; cross-zone
     navigation gives a short beep.
 10. M4.3: identical-VFO main-screen collapse with big digits
     (EEPROM 0x02480 font) + A/B corner badge (ui/main.c).
 11. M4.4 (DROPPED per owner decision - CSS menus stay stock):
     the merged MENU_CSS_DCS/MENU_CSS_CTCS experiment was fully reverted;
     the four stock CSS menus are byte-identical to upstream.
 12. M4.5: power-on PTT+side-key hidden-menu combo removed from
     helper/boot.c (the four ex-hidden items are normal system-zone
     menus; RESET already double-confirms via gAskForConfirmation).
 13. scheduler.c: SCHEDULER_GetTickCount10ms() accessor (millis10).

Encoding note: GB2312-encoded sources (app/menu.c, app/main.c,
sram-overlay.c, ...) were edited ASCII-only; their GBK byte streams are
byte-identical to upstream (verified). New labels for the two new menus
use ASCII ("SOS", "SEEK", "DCS", "CTCS") because the EEPROM font asset
is fixed; option strings reuse existing chinese.h glyph macros.

EEPROM usage (2Mib, spec §八): 0x38000 emergency mode, 0x38001 reserved
(prep-tone switch, unused), 0x38002 reserved (zone memory, unused),
0x38003 Live-VFO mode.

